<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Payment Failed</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
  <div style="background-color: #fff3cd; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #ffc107; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <h2 style="color: #856404; margin-top: 0;">Payment Failed for Your Subscription</h2>
    <p>Hi {{firstName}},</p>
    <p>We were unable to process your payment for your {{plan}} subscription.</p>
    <p><strong>Next payment attempt:</strong> {{nextRetryDate}}</p>
    <p>Please update your payment method to avoid service interruption.</p>
    <div style="margin: 30px 0; text-align: center;">
      <a href="{{updatePaymentUrl}}" style="background-color: #856404; color: white; padding: 12px 30px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; display: inline-block;">Update Payment Method</a>
    </div>
    <p>If you continue to experience issues, please contact our support team.</p>
    <p>Best regards,<br>The Axgrin Team</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>

